        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Bell Door Knob Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional design of Schlage's Bell Knob makes it an excellent choice for anyone looking for a classic look. It is made out of solid brass and comes in bright brass, antique brass, and satin chrome finishes. It is available in a ANSI grade 2 keyed lock function. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Bell Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece knob for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</B> of the F-Series Schlage Bell Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" up to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the knob while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (Keyed Entry Only):</b> Use when entry by a key is needed. Always locked, entry from the outside requires a key. The inside knob is always unlocked. The outside knob is fixed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bell Door Knob, Schlage F-BEL",
                "description": "Bell Knob Schlage F-BEL - The traditional design of Schlage's Bell Knob makes it an excellent choice for anyone looking for a classic look. It is made out of solid brass and comes in bright brass, antique brass, and satin chrome finishes. It is available in a ANSI grade 2 keyed lock function. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses.",
                "keywords": "Schlage Bell knobs,  Schlage f series Bell door knobs, keylock, passage sets, privacy sets, dummy sets, interiors locksets, F10BEL, f40BEL, f51BEL, f170BEL, SCH-Bell Knobs, Bell schlage knobs,"
